{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "707e17842f0e00f03631c6325acf9b3ad529b933a47f28cef55bdac30dd48152", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 神戸公演\n『Princess STATION』DAY2を\n無事に終え、改めて気を引き締める\n事務員たちの一幕です。", "zh": "UNI-ON@IR!!!!神户公演\n『Princess STATION』DAY2\n圆满落幕后，事务员们重新振作精神、\n绷紧心弦的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b001e7ed0add66b1d29278de67719d6864f678d6a784b31c8ab81cb4d84d3b34", "ja": "神戸公演も無事に終えることができました！\n二日間、お疲れ様でした～♪", "zh": "神户公演也顺利结束了！\n这两天辛苦大家了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1002_101kot", "source_sha256": "94685e33afdc3afd594c8bf6d4a7a066e6b54a1ce3a2bf19672bf7c7eed659e9", "ja": "お疲れさま、美咲ちゃん！　みんな可愛くて楽しくて、\nなんだかとってもプリンセスな公演だったわね！", "zh": "辛苦了，美咲！大家既可爱又开开心心的，\n总觉得真是一场特别有公主感觉的演出呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "43e905e4dbc31ae7123f8d9b7acd34524eac65206788d4530e86b8486e35b0e0", "ja": "はい！　みんな、と～ってもプリンセスでした♪", "zh": "好的！大家都超级～有公主风范呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "b747358423b2988974bfe247e4c0e42e8d0a40828d5b41f1252901c20b09654e", "ja": "はあ、女の子たちの永遠の憧れ、プリンセス……。\n私たちも素敵な王子様を探しましょうね？", "zh": "唉，公主……女孩子们永远憧憬的存在……\n我们也一起去寻找一位出色的王子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "e1e35d044121d3222b8a0efbf88820ed710c2681386afac777f9a229fc010d0d", "ja": "はーいっ♪\n……はーい？", "zh": "好——♪\n……好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "026acc1f4f4e462c9117a4fce13d72cd8a9a95ca94a0d9b5b2cd7d84486abb68", "ja": "小鳥さん、美咲ちゃん！\nお疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "小鸟小姐，美咲！\n辛苦啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "0c5bfa9425fffeca43fa9a6fb75c40d1cd6bff1969a1cc99eb54bc143a3a5e1d", "ja": "あら、未来ちゃん！\n二日間、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "哎呀，未来！\n这两天真的辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "42ecfe2d26b2db5729d29e2998bab98c8e76a87b1ef3aa9c301e1cdd1d4915a3", "ja": "お疲れさま！　二日とも、とってもステキで、\nとってもプリンセスだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦啦！两天都表现得特别棒，特别有公主范儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "08d92bbbc87df2edb2857049dedfa6c22b8e4a1f731764e8bbf8c0cfdfcff469", "ja": "わぁ、ホントですか！？\nでへへ、ホメられちゃった♪　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？\n嘿嘿嘿，被夸奖了♪　非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "3ba44bbca971f0c21b8dde572d4b4242ffc200d66875b635a6f4a6869f4fc17e", "ja": "でも、どうしたの？　まだライブが終った\nばっかりなのに、休まなくていいの？", "zh": "可是，怎么了？明明演出才刚结束，不休息一下没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d08efbfbf0affcf36ded7ee88801c6553695df700573b88b3372e322de0d012", "ja": "それが～。私、ライブが終っても、\n全然ドキドキが収まらなくて！", "zh": "是这样～我啊，演出结束后心跳还是完全停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc0ebea5448b3ba8770647fd3052f89821e5f4bf0ce3e99a4969a307e688e6c8", "ja": "じっとしていられなくて、いろんな人に会いに行ったり\nしてたら……楽屋がわからなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "因为根本坐不住，就去见了各种各样的人……结果……找不到休息室了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "ce49386d7469db2a732ac0500d33ac03b346e43251ee69541c47b354d22b6cf4", "ja": "まあ……！　さすがね未来ちゃん。\nそれはいわゆる、ライブあるある話よ！", "zh": "哎呀……！不愧是未来。\n这就是所谓的演出常见经历呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "042fca323fe3ba5c792c77ae79e38c0c758cb58147d1f1dcffe3d000e42acd9a", "ja": "でも、じっとしていられないなんて……。未来ちゃんは\nステージを降りても、元気なプリンセスなんだね♪", "zh": "不过，居然连安静待着都做不到……未来就算下了舞台，\n也还是个活力十足的公主呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "c4a665619fbfb64c5fbb0a47cd90d0154babdfef6665d7e22aad10f6beac91d4", "ja": "そうなのかな？　とりあえず、ありがとうございます！\nなので、戻る時について行かせてください！", "zh": "是这样吗？总之，谢谢您！所以，回去的时候请让我跟您一起走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b1dbcd9236bece7eb8ae95f412e721c95651188cff508ef8c5e36b01b97db06", "ja": "もちろん。せっかくだから、ライブが終ったばかりの\n未来ちゃんの感想、聞かせてもらおうかな？", "zh": "当然可以。难得有这个机会，能让我听听刚结束演出的未来的感想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "d91edde413b84a8416d74bd15b0e12ded969bcf84c23599fc188d1e0cfac2f34", "ja": "いいわね！　あーテステス、プリンセスの未来ちゃん、\n二日間の神戸公演を振り返って、ひと言お願いします！", "zh": "好主意！啊～试音试音，Princess的未来，\n回顾这两天的神户演出，请讲两句吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "b35c26304a3506a97ed965f2b37d9da5a7282bb6ef7ed616f3e1ef41588aee1e", "ja": "え、急にですか！？　うーん、読書感想文とか\n苦手なんですけど……。う～ん……。", "zh": "诶，突然要来吗！？嗯——我不太擅长写读书感想之类的……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "04166fd064f480fcf2b1a3cee5eb1875173f58a2db89c6652ddb49e07631c8fa", "ja": "えっと！　遠くまで旅行して、いつもと違う会場で、\nいつものお客さんとか、初めてのお客さんの前で……", "zh": "那个！去很远的地方旅行，在和平时不一样的会场，面对平时的客人，还有第一次来的客人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "fab5754c96def864c19cbde64f01b52e0e8a3caa6f24f974850d61bb88add562", "ja": "プリンセスのみんな、ユニットのみんなと一緒に、\nすっごく楽しいライブができて、とっても嬉しいです！", "zh": "能和公主组的大家、还有组合的大家一起，举办这么开心的演唱会，我特别高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "c071dd78ed8635cd80c2083f0a8b5c5bea4ff10d8b7027898ec0e20dfc3229e6", "ja": "今日で終わりなのが、すっごく残念ですけど～。\n次は、静香ちゃんたちの応援でがんばりまーす！", "zh": "虽然今天就要结束了，我真的觉得好遗憾～  \n接下来我会为静香她们加油，努力——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "cf5dd980a70d8e5deb8db520f1ef569aadf3d56fbc812070977ad6512a633995", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ～、ありがとうございました～！\nとってもステキなコメントだったよ、未来ちゃん♪", "zh": "啪啪啪～谢谢大家～！\n未来，你的发言真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "eced9d4101ab35b7fd73b8ba1e760499af25b2b13ae7ce40d470a69b711e2241", "ja": "ふふっ、美咲ちゃん、司会が板について来たわね～。\n未来ちゃんのコメントも素敵だったわ。100点満点♪", "zh": "呵呵，美咲，你越来越有主持人的样子了呢～。\n未来的感想也很棒。满分100分♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "80a7028b6866eaa018e1ea00c7fb6a17fb452e852677b2a15bbeb898e31148f1", "ja": "わ、ホントですか！？　やったー♪\n……今のメモしとこうっと。えっと、メモメモ……。", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？太好了♪\n……把刚才的话记下来吧。那个，记笔记记笔记……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "bf1f2b5f6f3aaf0544d9b292024bb80eaaf23fb6e82c86a8d3a1b80722bea962", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろ戻りましょうか。\nつもる話は打ち上げで、ね♪", "zh": "那么，我们也差不多该回去了吧。\n想聊的话就留到庆功宴上再聊吧，好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "b62cc2ddb65e57425cab73dcccc2df330f9fb03cc01470becca7f4da99520086", "ja": "はーい、打ち上げで……あ、そういえば、\n{$P$}さんが言ってたんですけど～。", "zh": "好——，那就在庆功宴上……啊，对了，\n{$P$}先生好像提到过～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "41d9d662e76fc7271983329cdced72ef1a09a26cbceffbe061b773dbc6983ad8", "ja": "今日の打ち上げ、神戸のお肉がたくさん\n出るんですって。おいしいといいですね！", "zh": "听说今天的庆功宴上会有很多神户牛肉。希望味道不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "8e21e4f9f4aa2b91e312d728f033ab395b5e94ada19b8202926e01bf1264d4dc", "ja": "神戸のお肉！？", "zh": "神户的牛肉！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "253dea0df37285a450bc6653e77b84fc780f62e6b0ff747ef16382b4e2c44653", "ja": "こうしちゃいられないわ！　急ぎましょう美咲ちゃん！\n待ってなさい、神戸のお肉ー！！", "zh": "不能在这干耗着了！我们快走吧美咲！\n等着瞧吧，神户牛肉——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1030_102mis", "source_sha256": "328464a7d8ef88cbdd9f719ef894b2083878334c2d0f066bb9914cad5cdc5f5f", "ja": "……さあ未来ちゃん、私たちも行こっか。\nプリンセス公演は、終わっちゃったけど……。", "zh": "……来吧未来，我们也走吧。\n虽然Princess公演已经结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_05_1031_102mis", "source_sha256": "7639d9edc9b162b27e833d0fe85d8cf176360ce8b2620b22433abbb13ff026f3", "ja": "まだまだ、楽しい時間はこれからだよね！\n……えへへっ♪", "zh": "开心的时光接下来才刚要开始呢！\n……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
